    "html": "<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header><div class=\"brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/assets/logo.jpg\" alt=\"DRA Tax &amp; Financial Solutions logo\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"tax-services.html\">Tax Services</a><a href=\"resources.html\">Resources</a><a href=\"about.html\">About</a></nav><a class=\"header-cta\" href=\"contact.html\">Get a Free Consultation</a></header>\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"mentorship\">\n<style>\n.mentorship{--mentor-navy:#0b192e;--mentor-gold:#d6b783;--mentor-ivory:#f4f0e9;color:#101c2d;background:var(--mentor-ivory)}\n.mentorship .mentor-wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 64px));margin-inline:auto}\n.mentorship .mentor-hero{background:#071325;color:var(--mentor-ivory)}\n.mentorship .mentor-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .85fr;min-height:570px;align-items:stretch;gap:56px}\n.mentorship .mentor-hero-copy{align-self:center;padding:65px 0}\n.mentorship .mentor-label{color:var(--mentor-gold);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 18px}\n.mentorship h1,.mentorship h2,.mentorship h3{font-family:Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.07;margin:0}\n.mentorship h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6.2vw,86px);color:inherit}\n.mentorship h1 em{color:var(--mentor-gold);font-weight:400}\n.mentorship h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,55px);color:inherit}\n.mentorship h3{font-size:27px;color:inherit}\n.mentorship p{line-height:1.6}\n.mentorship .mentor-hero-copy>p:not(.mentor-label){font-size:18px;max-width:500px;margin:22px 0 27px}\n.mentorship .mentor-portrait{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;max-height:660px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 38%}\n.mentorship .mentor-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:12px 22px;background:var(--mentor-gold);color:#071325;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;text-align:center}\n.mentorship .mentor-btn:hover{background:#eed3a8;color:#071325}\n.mentorship .mentor-band{padding:clamp(44px,7vw,94px) 0}\n.mentorship .mentor-audience{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:44px;align-items:start}\n.mentorship .mentor-audience p{margin:0;font-size:18px}\n.mentorship .mentor-topics{background:var(--mentor-navy);color:var(--mentor-ivory)}\n.mentorship .mentor-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 42px;margin-top:32px}\n.mentorship .mentor-grid article{padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #d6b78380}\n.mentorship .mentor-grid article p{margin:8px 0 0}\n.mentorship .mentor-paths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;margin-top:26px}\n.mentorship .mentor-paths article{border-top:2px solid #ad8d55;padding-top:20px}\n.mentorship .mentor-paths p{margin:12px 0 18px}\n.mentorship .mentor-resource{background:#e9e0d0;padding:28px 0}\n.mentorship .mentor-resource .mentor-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.mentorship .mentor-resource p{margin:5px 0 0}\n.mentorship .mentor-resource a{color:#142743;font-weight:700;text-underline-offset:4px}\n@media(max-width:740px){.mentorship .mentor-wrap{width:calc(100% - 36px)}.mentorship .mentor-hero-grid,.mentorship .mentor-audience,.mentorship .mentor-grid,.mentorship .mentor-paths{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.mentorship .mentor-hero-copy{padding:37px 0 3px}.mentorship .mentor-portrait{max-height:420px;object-position:center 40%}.mentorship .mentor-grid{gap:0}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"mentor-hero\"><div class=\"mentor-wrap mentor-hero-grid\"><div class=\"mentor-hero-copy\">\n<p class=\"mentor-label\">Tax Mentorship &amp; Opportunities</p><h1>Ready to start your <em>own tax business?</em></h1>\n<p>Talk with Deneshia Renee about training, tax software, and what it takes to build a practice of your own.</p>\n<a class=\"mentor-btn\" href=\"https://draw.downrightausomewealth.com/widget/booking/Eo6P4A5bLSnnPldXZ38e\">Book a Mentorship Consultation</a>\n</div><img class=\"mentor-portrait\" src=\"/assets/deneshia-hero.webp\" alt=\"Deneshia Renee, founder of DRA Tax &amp; Financial Solutions\" width=\"939\" height=\"1675\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"mentor-band\"><div class=\"mentor-wrap mentor-audience\"><h2>Is this the right next step for you?</h2><p>If you’re considering tax preparation for the first time or already preparing returns and looking to build your own practice, a consultation can help you identify the training, tools, and support to explore next.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"mentor-band mentor-topics\"><div class=\"mentor-wrap\"><h2>What you can explore with Deneshia</h2><div class=\"mentor-grid\">\n<article><h3>Mentorship</h3><p>Talk through your goals and the kind of guidance that fits your experience.</p></article>\n<article><h3>Tax preparation training</h3><p>Ask about training options and where to start preparing to serve clients.</p></article>\n<article><h3>Tax software</h3><p>Explore software options and what to consider before choosing tools for your practice.</p></article>\n<article><h3>Business startup resources</h3><p>Discuss how to organize your practice and prepare for your first filing season.</p></article>\n</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"mentor-band\"><div class=\"mentor-wrap\"><h2>Choose your next step</h2><div class=\"mentor-paths\">\n<article><h3>Talk it through with Deneshia</h3><p>Bring your questions about training, software, or starting a tax business.</p><a class=\"mentor-btn\" href=\"https://draw.downrightausomewealth.com/widget/booking/Eo6P4A5bLSnnPldXZ38e\">Book a Mentorship Consultation</a></article>\n<article><h3>Review Tier 1 enrollment</h3><p>Explore the program through The Tax Advisor &amp; Associates. If the enrollment form asks for a referral agent, enter <strong>Deneshia Renee</strong>.</p><a class=\"mentor-btn\" href=\"https://thetaxadvisorandassociates.com/tier-1\">View Tier 1 &amp; Enroll</a></article>\n</div></div></section>\n<aside class=\"mentor-resource\" aria-label=\"External training resource\"><div class=\"mentor-wrap\"><div><h3>Tax Business Boot Camp</h3><p>Training event hosted by an independent organizer.</p></div><a href=\"https://startataxbizzlivevent.com/LEARN-MORE\">View Boot Camp Details</a></div></aside>\n</main>\n<footer><div class=\"footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-col\"><img src=\"/assets/logo.jpg\" alt=\"DRA Tax &amp; Financial Solutions logo\" decoding=\"async\"><p><strong>Deneshia Renee</strong><br>CEO<br>Down Right Ausome Wealth</p><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dra.taxsolutions/\">Instagram: dra.taxsolutions</a></p></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>Explore</h4><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"tax-services.html\">Tax Services</a><a href=\"resources.html\">Resources</a><a href=\"about.html\">About</a><a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a><a href=\"book-an-appointment.html\">Book An Appointment</a></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>Services</h4><a href=\"resources.html\">Resources</a><a href=\"tax-services.html\">Tax Preparation</a><a href=\"contact.html\">Financial Coaching</a></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>Let&rsquo;s Connect</h4><p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+14705161141\">470 516 1141</a></p><p><a href=\"mailto:admin@downrightausomewealth.com\">admin@downrightausomewealth.com</a></p><p>3205 Woodward Crossing Blvd, Suite F, Buford, GA</p><p>Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00am&ndash;8:00pm, Sunday closed</p></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>&copy; 2026 Down Right Ausome Wealth. All rights reserved.</span><span><a href=\"testimonials.html\">Testimonials</a> <a href=\"privacy-policy.html\">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href=\"terms-of-service.html\">Terms of Service</a> &middot; <a href=\"disclaimer.html\">Disclaimer</a></span></div><div class=\"compliance\">No outcome, score increase, refund, or approval is guaranteed.</div></footer>\n"
